PLACEHOLDER -- this filename is reserved for the binary Autodesk Fusion 360
parametric source for the LANCET cartridge tube assembly. The binary file
will be committed in the v0.1.0 release tagged for Zenodo archiving.

The authoritative parametric description until then is in
tube_assembly.f3d.notes.md (same directory). All dimensions, tolerances,
and export procedures are documented there.

